        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">FF155 Adds support for the Audio Session API](<a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Audio_Session_API\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Audio_Session_API</a>).<br>\nThis updates the docs to add missing properties and events to track changes in the audio <em>state</em> (matching spec).</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Related docs work can be tracked in <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"5170080092\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45184\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/45184/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/45184\">#45184</a></p>",
